---
source: term/tests/help_snapshots.rs
expression: "help_output(\"wall\")"
---
Write a message to all users

Usage: wall [OPTIONS] [MESSAGE]...

Arguments:
  [MESSAGE]...  Message or file to send

Options:
  -n, --nobanner           Suppress the banner (root only)
  -t, --timeout <TIMEOUT>  Write timeout in seconds [default: 300]
  -g, --group <GROUP>      Limit message to members of a group
  -h, --help               Print help
